        {
            "id": 6668992,
            "title": "〈台股盤後〉限空令2.0擋不住賣壓狂瀉2393點創史上第三大跌點 本周跌逾7000點跌幅17.5%",
            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>電子權值值、傳產全倒今(20)日全倒，上市櫃365家公司慘亮綠燈，即便金管會祭出「有條件禁空令」，仍擋不住沈重賣壓，台股今天早盤以37646.13點開低後一路下殺，一度跌至35738.68點，終場跌2393.6點或6.23%，創史上第三大跌點，收36033.29點，成交量8773.5億元。台股本周狂瀉7641.83點，跌幅17.5%，周線收黑。 </p></section><p></p><div class=\"c1hvmcli\"><figure><div class=\"iirgi4a\"><img alt=\"cover image of news article\" src=\"https://cimg.cnyes.cool/prod/news/6668992/l/150fee2d19c7fe40eeb69bed514f5747.jpg\"/></div><figcaption class=\"c1gcnfq1\">限空令2.0擋不住賣壓狂瀉2393點創史上第三大跌點，本周跌逾7000點跌逾17%。(圖：shutterstock)</figcaption></figure></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>電子權值股倒一片，台積電(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2330:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2330\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2330-TW</a>)跌100元或4.76%，收2000元，聯發科(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2454:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2454\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2454-TW</a>)、台達電(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2308:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2308\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2308-TW</a>)雙雙跌停亮綠燈，聯電(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2303:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2303\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2303-TW</a>)、日月光(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:3711:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/3711\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">3711-TW</a>)跌逾半根停板，鴻海(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2317:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2317\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2317-TW</a>)跌逾4%，廣達(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2382:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2382\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2382-TW</a>)跌4%。另外，金融權值股同樣跌幅沈重，國泰金(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2882:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2882\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2882-TW</a>)、富邦金(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2881:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2881\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2881-TW</a>)、中信金(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2891:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2891\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2891-TW</a>)皆跌逾半根停板。 </p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>千金股今天仍為重災區，除千金俱樂部剩30檔，且有23檔跌停，僅有創新服務(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:7828:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/7828\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">7828-TW</a>)萬綠叢中一點紅，逆勢亮紅燈。 </p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>今天資安族群則反向吸引買盤，茲仁大資訊(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:7767:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/7767\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">7767-TW</a>)、中華資安(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:7765:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/7765\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">7765-TW</a>)、華經(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2468:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2468\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2468-TW</a>)、資拓宏宇(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:6614:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/6614\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">6614-TW</a>)、資通(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2471:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2471\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2471-TW</a>)紛紛強攻漲停。 </p></section></main>",
